WEBVTT

01:35.470 --> 01:38.220
Pigs! Discard your kindness!

01:38.220 --> 01:40.700
Who cares about friendship and whatnot just to simply live?

01:40.700 --> 01:44.040
It's a wrong equal to doing
"number 2" on top of a five star dish!

02:01.420 --> 02:05.810
Hey, Daddy, let's play.

02:05.810 --> 02:07.900
Let's go somewhere with everyone and play.

02:07.900 --> 02:09.850
Can't we, Daddy?

02:09.850 --> 02:11.110
Daddy?

02:11.110 --> 02:15.640
I'm sure Yuuka wants to go play, too.

02:16.780 --> 02:17.980
Be quiet!

02:17.980 --> 02:20.700
Don't use Yuuka to make childish requests.

02:21.120 --> 02:23.910
He's right...  It is childish, right?

02:25.190 --> 02:26.370
Y-Yuuka?

02:26.370 --> 02:29.540
I know. I really do.

02:29.540 --> 02:34.550
You made her cry. You made Yuuka cry.

02:34.550 --> 02:37.490
Evil, evil monster.

02:37.490 --> 02:39.790
Ouka made her cry.

02:39.790 --> 02:42.240
Yuuka, do you want to go somewhere?

02:39.790 --> 02:42.660
Evil, evil monster.

02:42.240 --> 02:44.640
It's all right. You're busy.

02:45.160 --> 02:47.240
Where do you want to go, Yuuka?

02:47.960 --> 02:49.560
The zoo.

02:49.560 --> 02:50.880
The zoo, eh?

02:50.110 --> 02:53.160
Hey, stop ignoring me!

02:50.880 --> 02:53.450
Apparently Teika-kun's friend is there.

02:53.450 --> 02:54.730
Forget that. Let's go to an amusement park.

02:54.730 --> 02:57.190
Or how about we go to Guinea?

02:57.190 --> 03:00.370
I wonder if his friend is inside the fence.

03:00.370 --> 03:02.860
If it's a lion, then of course it'd be inside the fence.

03:02.860 --> 03:05.950
Teika-kun is a lion, too, but he is part of our family.

03:13.100 --> 03:13.950
Madara.

03:15.280 --> 03:17.840
You said you'd come by at noon.

03:17.840 --> 03:22.430
Oh, don't mind me. It's your discretion to come to the zoo or not.

03:22.430 --> 03:23.970
I'm not mad or anything.

03:24.260 --> 03:25.940
I'm sorry, Madara.

03:25.940 --> 03:27.910
Would you please cheer up?

03:27.910 --> 03:29.810
It'll be closing soon.

03:30.560 --> 03:34.480
I guess I can let you off the hook.
I've got something to ask you, too.

03:34.480 --> 03:35.520
Hey!

03:37.630 --> 03:38.440
That's...

03:38.990 --> 03:40.920
Even I don't know.

03:40.920 --> 03:43.340
She's a baby lion, but was here when I woke up.

03:43.340 --> 03:45.530
I finally managed to get her to tell me her name.

03:45.900 --> 03:51.010
The Bister King can communicate with every kind of animal.

03:51.010 --> 03:56.470
You, as the royal heir to the Bister King title,
should be able to talk with her.

03:56.850 --> 03:59.300
You are of the Bister King's lineage, as well.

03:59.300 --> 04:01.600
I'm not!

04:01.600 --> 04:04.970
Those born with white fur are not accepted as descendants of the Bister King!

04:04.970 --> 04:09.610
You know who gave me these scars!

04:12.250 --> 04:14.410
Where are you from?

04:14.410 --> 04:15.900
I'm Midarezaki Teika.

04:16.620 --> 04:18.150
Midarezaki?

04:23.020 --> 04:28.120
Calm down. I may have a scary look, but I am famous for being not scary at all amongst my neighbors.

04:35.550 --> 04:37.050
Something smells suspicious.

04:37.050 --> 04:39.020
I'll chase after that man.

04:39.650 --> 04:41.890
You stay with the girl.

04:42.980 --> 04:43.950
Shakuya!

04:44.620 --> 04:45.720
Shakuya...

04:47.630 --> 04:52.540
A Bister King descendant gets held in by a fence?

04:52.540 --> 04:56.230
Or, is your heart the real obstacle?

04:56.610 --> 04:58.940
What's this, Hakushaku? Do you want me to eat you?

04:58.940 --> 05:00.480
Ohhh, how scary.

05:03.700 --> 05:06.660
Oh, you surprised me, Teika-kun.

05:07.460 --> 05:10.160
Shizuka-dono, excellent effort doing your part-time work here.

05:10.160 --> 05:12.610
Did you come to see Madara again?

05:12.610 --> 05:13.490
Yes.

05:13.490 --> 05:16.420
Also, would you by any chance know of any staff members wearing sunglasses?

05:16.780 --> 05:18.190
Sunglasses?

05:18.190 --> 05:20.150
I think you're looking for Takahaka-san.

05:20.150 --> 05:21.180
Takahaka?

05:21.690 --> 05:23.670
Yes, he's new.

05:23.670 --> 05:26.130
Something's strange about this zoo recently.

05:26.570 --> 05:27.360
Strange?

05:27.700 --> 05:31.330
Like employing new staff without any prior experience, like Takahaka-san.

05:31.330 --> 05:34.110
Like increasing the number of animals when we don't have much room to keep them.

05:36.200 --> 05:41.370
I'll contact you when I find out anything, so you should stick around with Madara.

05:41.370 --> 05:42.660
Shizuka-dono.

05:42.660 --> 05:46.030
Madara looks happy when Teika-kun is nearby.

06:00.510 --> 06:03.210
Head, you're eating way too much.

06:03.210 --> 06:06.210
I did my work! So give me back my snack!

06:06.210 --> 06:07.540
Sure, sure.

06:07.540 --> 06:11.350
Anyway, the cleanup work after
the beastman case is done, right?

06:11.350 --> 06:14.680
Yes. Fixing the roads and building; all done.

06:14.680 --> 06:17.600
So, what happened to the Momokusa after that?

06:17.600 --> 06:19.690
Needless to say, they lost power.

06:19.850 --> 06:24.830
Then, what happened to
the head of Momokusa and his daughter?

06:24.830 --> 06:28.590
If I'm right, she was a good friend of Midarezaki Chika-chan.

06:28.590 --> 06:30.910
I'll look into it.

06:41.370 --> 06:46.090
Time for a fun game!

06:47.240 --> 06:52.930
Aside from Ginka, who's not here today, where are the other children who were on the Ferris wheel a moment ago?

06:52.930 --> 06:56.180
The Second Find the Children Race!

06:56.390 --> 06:59.420
Why do I sense a malicious intent from this?

06:59.420 --> 07:03.190
I'm trying to make this family trip Yuuka wished for more eventful.

07:03.760 --> 07:06.810
You're holding a grudge for how I ignored you the other day, aren't you?

07:06.810 --> 07:11.150
I will observe your actions through this remote-controlled petite Kyouka-sama.

07:14.590 --> 07:15.490
Father!

07:16.040 --> 07:17.540
Are you all right?

07:19.540 --> 07:21.050
So many things in life.

07:21.050 --> 07:22.780
So many Kyoukas, as well.

07:22.780 --> 07:23.110
PLACEHOLDER

07:22.780 --> 07:23.850
So many things in life.

07:23.110 --> 07:26.040
Currently there are four children missing.

07:26.040 --> 07:29.300
If you find three before noon, then you win.

07:29.300 --> 07:31.760
Why do I feel something's unfair?

07:32.410 --> 07:34.800
This time, you're the only one to search the children.

07:34.800 --> 07:36.750
In other words, a penalty game.

07:35.960 --> 07:39.020
Start searching or else you'll lose!

07:39.020 --> 07:41.410
Just so you know, if you lose, you'll be a dog for one month!

07:41.410 --> 07:42.820
Ready, begin!

07:42.820 --> 07:46.150
Father, I have been chosen as your guide.

07:46.150 --> 07:49.650
Today's a day to be spent with the family. I am sure Madara will understand.

07:50.660 --> 07:52.560
Sheep are cute.

07:54.630 --> 07:56.370
There he is.

07:56.370 --> 07:58.870
Hey, Hyouka!

07:58.870 --> 08:00.520
Father, keep it down.

08:04.040 --> 08:06.790
H-H-Help me!

08:06.950 --> 08:08.040
Hyouka?

08:08.200 --> 08:09.550
I'm coming now!

08:15.140 --> 08:16.010
Look.

08:16.670 --> 08:21.860
Don't scream or throw food at us.

08:29.360 --> 08:35.450
Sign: Petting Zoo

08:29.360 --> 08:32.530
This way, Hyouka. It's okay now.

08:33.950 --> 08:34.710
Hyouka?

08:34.710 --> 08:37.460
Father... Animals are scary.

08:37.460 --> 08:39.080
They're so scary.

08:41.580 --> 08:44.710
Are you not used to handling animals, Father?

08:44.710 --> 08:48.580
Th-That's not true. I just wasn't thinking there.

08:48.580 --> 08:50.280
If they're small animals...

08:53.210 --> 08:54.930
OW!

08:57.140 --> 08:59.140
Ouch! Father, they're hurting me.

09:00.630 --> 09:02.630
What's gotten into you all?

09:02.630 --> 09:05.060
Father, did you do something to make the animals mad?

09:05.060 --> 09:08.270
I wouldn't do such a thing!

09:08.550 --> 09:10.300
Father, calm down!

09:17.080 --> 09:18.450
G-Gekka?

09:20.580 --> 09:22.160
I'm not good with them.

09:25.230 --> 09:25.910
Chika-san?

09:26.380 --> 09:29.260
It's gross!

09:31.500 --> 09:37.510
Sign: Reptile Dome

09:31.950 --> 09:33.990
Chika-san, you look perfect in there.

09:34.760 --> 09:36.600
I hate snakes!

09:36.600 --> 09:39.800
The snake says he's taken a liking to Chika-dono.

09:39.800 --> 09:42.600
No! Don't!

09:42.600 --> 09:45.040
Anyway, I've found three.

09:45.880 --> 09:47.060
Petit Kyouka.

09:47.060 --> 09:48.330
What, four-eyes?

09:50.840 --> 09:53.130
You're really like someone I know even though you're small!

09:53.130 --> 09:55.100
I want to get in touch with Kyouka.

09:55.100 --> 09:57.240
You monkey! You monkey! You monkey!

09:57.240 --> 09:58.390
What? You want to say more?

09:58.390 --> 09:59.770
Mom!

10:00.170 --> 10:02.200
This voice is... Yuuka?

10:02.200 --> 10:03.980
It's coming from the monkey mountain.

10:03.980 --> 10:05.920
Something must have happened. Let's hurry over.

10:05.920 --> 10:06.720
This way!

10:06.720 --> 10:10.790
No! Don't leave me!

10:15.740 --> 10:16.950
Let Yuuka go!

10:16.950 --> 10:23.250
She still can't eat green peppers or go to the bathroom alone at night, but she's still my cute daughter!

10:22.090 --> 10:23.580
Stop it, Mom.

10:23.580 --> 10:26.670
Don't shout out my weaknesses!

10:25.190 --> 10:26.670
Father, look.

10:26.670 --> 10:27.590
Yuuka!

10:28.230 --> 10:30.980
You look as stupid as Ouka!

10:30.980 --> 10:33.360
You look as uneducated as Ouka!

10:33.360 --> 10:34.980
You look as vulgar as Ouka!

10:35.980 --> 10:39.490
I'll go give her a lesson while I go save Yuuka.

10:39.490 --> 10:41.700
Father, hold for a moment.

10:42.450 --> 10:43.590
What is this about?!

10:47.370 --> 10:50.170
That human is my honored sister.

10:53.630 --> 10:55.810
It's all right. Ignorance is not a sin.

10:55.810 --> 11:00.340
However you are sinful for causing a disturbance and putting your monkeys in danger.

11:00.340 --> 11:01.710
Teika-kun.

11:02.320 --> 11:05.460
I won't do anything to them, Honored Sister.

11:06.000 --> 11:10.380
Now that we're all here,
let's show what the Midarezaki have.

11:10.380 --> 11:12.980
Therefore everyone under ten years old, go!

11:12.980 --> 11:14.220
I'm participating in this, too?

11:14.220 --> 11:16.200
I'm scared. I'm scared of pigs.

11:16.200 --> 11:20.110
Even if they are under ten,
wouldn't that be cheating too much?

11:21.810 --> 11:25.120
Even though you're my brother, I won't go easy on you.

11:25.120 --> 11:27.410
Honored Sister is ready to win this...

11:27.410 --> 11:29.950
I-I'm putting my money on Yuuka.

11:29.950 --> 11:32.040
I think I'll go with Lion-san.

11:32.040 --> 11:34.790
You should join the race, too. It'll be lots of fun.

11:34.790 --> 11:39.510
Are you her father? Please don't worry. It's a fun race.

11:35.170 --> 11:39.330
W-W-W-Wait a moment! Kyouka-sama's not a child!

11:39.510 --> 11:42.260
So you're called Kyouka-chan? Follow me.

11:42.260 --> 11:45.040
You should listen to what others say!

11:46.760 --> 11:48.270
Go, Lion-san!

11:48.270 --> 11:49.180
Keep it up, Yuuka!

11:51.410 --> 11:53.960
You're so lucky, Mom. You got the first prize.

11:53.960 --> 11:55.950
I'm simply jealous.

11:55.950 --> 11:57.870
You can have this.

11:57.870 --> 11:59.980
Thank you, Mom!

11:59.980 --> 12:02.900
Kitty won by a mile.

12:02.900 --> 12:05.540
I don't know what to say;
she was serious against children on a pig.

12:05.540 --> 12:10.250
Are you familiar with the proverb that goes,
lions use everything they have to hunt even a rabbit?

12:10.250 --> 12:14.110
Honored Sister, we're almost at where Madara is.

12:14.110 --> 12:16.750
Yup, Teika-kun. I simply can't wait.

12:17.620 --> 12:21.560
Madara! I've come today with my family.

12:23.650 --> 12:24.430
Madara?

12:29.080 --> 12:30.430
I see.

12:30.430 --> 12:31.930
I knew something was strange.

12:32.240 --> 12:34.440
Shakuya! Have you become a human's cattle?!

12:34.700 --> 12:36.020
What did you say?

12:38.790 --> 12:40.480
Madara, you don't have to worry.

12:40.650 --> 12:41.500
They and I are-

12:41.500 --> 12:44.160
I'm happy that you have a precious family.

12:44.160 --> 12:49.230
It's a happiness you gained by discarding the pride of a Bister King and becoming a human's cattle.

12:49.230 --> 12:51.240
Make sure you take good care.

12:51.240 --> 12:54.420
No! You have it wrong!

12:54.420 --> 12:57.620
You once said that you'll create a wonderful kingdom, right?

12:57.970 --> 13:04.630
One where even I can live, a kingdom controlled by the Bister King and not humans.

13:06.700 --> 13:07.740
Forget it...

13:08.160 --> 13:11.650
Forget it already. I won't think of you as the king among beasts anymore.

13:13.070 --> 13:14.660
Don't show your face ever again.

13:15.180 --> 13:16.070
Madara!

13:16.070 --> 13:20.200
Shut up! I don't want human cattle calling my name!

13:20.200 --> 13:23.210
Get lost already. Teika, was it?

13:31.340 --> 13:32.530
Bastard.

13:34.710 --> 13:38.020
Hakushaku! Where did you go?!

13:38.020 --> 13:40.750
You idiot. You get lost because
a prince is outside your premises.

13:40.750 --> 13:44.230
Don't be so loud. Zebras are real cowards.

13:47.350 --> 13:49.140
I can't sit and watch that idiot.

13:49.140 --> 13:51.070
You idiot! Don't just sit there!

13:52.890 --> 13:54.980
Who might you be?

13:54.980 --> 13:56.970
I am of the lineage of the Bister King,

13:56.970 --> 14:00.160
Forget the greeting! Run! Or else I'll bite you!

14:00.160 --> 14:01.560
This way! Follow me!

14:01.560 --> 14:02.480
Wait!

14:02.480 --> 14:05.270
What's with that? You call that running?

14:05.270 --> 14:07.260
I'm doing my best!

14:10.400 --> 14:13.250
I will never forget your kindness.

14:13.840 --> 14:15.900
I will return this favor one day.

14:15.900 --> 14:16.950
Forget it.

14:16.950 --> 14:18.330
Go home already.

14:18.330 --> 14:20.350
My name is Shakuya!

14:20.350 --> 14:22.340
What's your name?!

14:24.790 --> 14:26.790
What is your name?!

14:28.390 --> 14:29.820
Oh, shut up.

14:30.330 --> 14:31.620
It's Madara!

14:31.620 --> 14:33.400
I'm Madara from the Bone Valley!

14:33.850 --> 14:35.550
Madara, eh?

14:35.550 --> 14:36.680
I won't forget you!

14:57.020 --> 14:58.760
I'll protect Ai.

14:58.760 --> 15:01.160
I won't let humans have their way.

15:01.160 --> 15:05.290
Do humans think they control the world?

15:21.610 --> 15:22.490
What the hell?

15:28.650 --> 15:29.830
You're joking...

15:29.830 --> 15:35.570
We predict that this will spread around the world in no time and change all humans to animals.

15:35.570 --> 15:39.270
It's a crazy case where humans are turning into animals,

15:39.270 --> 15:40.790
but no matter how you look at it,

15:40.790 --> 15:42.790
this is a crisis for the human race!

15:44.080 --> 15:45.000
Honored Sister.

15:45.540 --> 15:47.130
You don't have to worry about it.

15:47.130 --> 15:48.050
But...

15:48.050 --> 15:50.670
He's right. What we should be worrying about now is our dinner.

15:50.670 --> 15:53.700
If you're hungry, your brain won't think, either.

15:54.340 --> 15:58.140
I doubt a good idea will come from you even if your stomach's full.

15:58.140 --> 15:59.030
I'm home.

16:01.570 --> 16:02.350
Oh my.

16:02.350 --> 16:06.070
Too slow, Ginka! Your hamburger's already in my stomach!

16:04.450 --> 16:05.510
Father?

16:11.420 --> 16:14.560
I hope I'm mistaken.

16:14.560 --> 16:18.150
Would you possibly be Dr. Gebok who Hyouka blew away?

16:15.700 --> 16:19.440
I-I'm not trying to get Thirteen this time at all!

16:18.540 --> 16:21.830
Ginka-kun! I'll set aside asking why you're in a chinese dress.

16:21.830 --> 16:24.270
But why did you come home with this scientist?

16:24.270 --> 16:25.170
You have to choose who you become friends with.

16:25.170 --> 16:32.230
No, we're not really friends, but we were drinking at Virgo, and I couldn't just leave him, so I had to bring him home.

16:32.570 --> 16:33.790
I see.

16:34.960 --> 16:36.080
Let's do that.

16:37.150 --> 16:41.470
It's not good for the raising of children, so I'll let you go for now.

16:42.580 --> 16:45.550
Kyouka, we'll be doing that to him tonight,
so please help me out.

16:45.550 --> 16:47.590
Sure. Not sure what exactly, but it sounds like fun.

16:47.590 --> 16:48.710
Where's my hamburger?

16:48.710 --> 16:51.060
I said I ate it, didn't I?

16:50.400 --> 16:51.380
What?

16:51.060 --> 16:52.320
I'll give you mine.

16:51.380 --> 16:52.320
What exactly is that?

16:52.670 --> 16:53.820
No! He's having mine!

16:54.070 --> 16:56.200
Hakushaku, is that you? Long time no see.

16:56.840 --> 16:59.260
What? Madara escaped from the zoo?

16:56.870 --> 16:58.640
Answer me!

16:59.260 --> 17:00.260
Teika-kun?

17:01.630 --> 17:04.540
Sorry to disturb you.

17:03.040 --> 17:04.540
You're all going to ignore me?

17:05.080 --> 17:06.730
Hi-Hiratsuka Raichou!

17:06.730 --> 17:10.040
Would you all listen to me first?

17:10.040 --> 17:11.100
You'll keep ignoring me?

17:11.100 --> 17:15.380
Soon, all humans in the entire world will be in big trouble.

17:15.550 --> 17:18.320
And this is hard to say, but...

17:18.320 --> 17:23.790
You're the only ones who can solve this matter, so do something about it please. Thanks.

17:45.390 --> 17:47.900
Hey, this place is off limits!

17:49.000 --> 17:51.210
Y-You're Grim Reaper!

17:51.310 --> 17:52.850
Where's the Vice-Head?

17:52.850 --> 17:54.670
He's being detained by Raichou, right?

17:54.670 --> 17:56.690
I can't tell you!

17:58.450 --> 18:01.440
Hanayama Vice-Head is practically my father.

18:01.440 --> 18:04.240
Tell me where he is and I'll spare your life.

18:04.240 --> 18:05.480
O-Over there.

18:11.790 --> 18:12.830
Father?

18:13.350 --> 18:14.970
Father!

18:16.290 --> 18:19.080
I was too late?

18:21.150 --> 18:22.390
Poke poke?

18:23.470 --> 18:25.480
It's a bear!

18:25.480 --> 18:28.960
I found a cute little teddy bear.

18:28.960 --> 18:34.130
But strange. What is such a lovely teddy bear doing here?

18:37.880 --> 18:40.660
Ha...na...ya...ma...

18:41.410 --> 18:43.100
Hanayama?

18:43.100 --> 18:44.520
Father?!

18:45.260 --> 18:46.750
Seriously?

18:48.630 --> 18:50.730
What is my real name?

18:52.140 --> 18:54.080
Shi...ru...ku...

18:54.450 --> 18:55.530
What about my last name?

18:56.570 --> 18:59.190
Ki...ri...sa...ki...

18:59.190 --> 19:01.280
This is starting to look real.

19:02.110 --> 19:05.120
The one who read my diary like five years ago was?

19:06.240 --> 19:07.620
That was myself.

19:07.720 --> 19:10.000
So it was you!

19:10.000 --> 19:11.170
How dare you violate your daughter's privacy?!

19:11.170 --> 19:13.030
I kill you! I kill you! I kill you! I kill you!

19:14.330 --> 19:18.070
Anyway, I understand that you're my father.

19:18.070 --> 19:19.810
Let's get out of here for now.

19:19.810 --> 19:21.380
One moment please.

19:21.980 --> 19:26.230
If the Vice-Head gets away,
I'm the one that gets yelled at for it.

19:26.230 --> 19:28.140
Spider, was it?

19:28.140 --> 19:29.890
It'd be helpful if you would get out of my way!

19:35.050 --> 19:37.780
What is going on?!

19:45.620 --> 19:46.660
Wh-What?

19:47.190 --> 19:49.440
What kind of joke is this?

19:55.990 --> 19:58.210
It's so good.

19:58.210 --> 20:02.200
Marry me!

19:59.540 --> 20:00.720
Hiratsuka-sama?

20:02.200 --> 20:05.540
This is my first time eating something this good!

20:04.530 --> 20:06.320
Please let go of me, Hiratsuka-sama.

20:05.540 --> 20:07.980
Marry me!

20:09.370 --> 20:12.860
Hey, it could break my skull,
so don't throw something heavy like that.

20:11.060 --> 20:16.420
Raichou, don't seduce pure Nishikura-san for a childish reason.

20:16.830 --> 20:22.620
Nishikura-san, just to warn you, if you don't think ahead about marriage, you'll ruin your life like me.

20:22.620 --> 20:25.900
Darling! If you don't want your tongue pulled out, then shut up.

20:25.900 --> 20:31.300
Raichou, you appeared all of a sudden last night and here we are at Choukokutou.

20:31.300 --> 20:34.080
Would you start explaining what's going on?

20:34.080 --> 20:36.610
Okay, well, listen closely.

20:36.610 --> 20:41.410
Right now, cases where humans are turning into animals are happening all around the world.

20:42.240 --> 20:44.720
Something like the beastman case from a bit ago?

20:44.910 --> 20:46.410
A little different.

20:46.410 --> 20:49.370
This time, they're completely turning into animals.

20:49.370 --> 20:51.130
Into helpless animals.

20:51.130 --> 20:53.880
And this is spreading at great speed.

20:53.880 --> 20:56.600
That's why we took shelter here.

20:56.880 --> 20:58.790
The food's going to get cold.

21:00.420 --> 21:01.570
Everyone eat up.

21:01.570 --> 21:03.950
We need to think and eat at the same time.

21:02.190 --> 21:03.150
Madara...

21:05.220 --> 21:06.990
Madara.

21:08.480 --> 21:09.490
What?

21:09.490 --> 21:12.000
Stop lying around and let's go find food.

21:12.000 --> 21:13.720
Everyone's noisy, saying they're hungry.

21:13.720 --> 21:14.550
"Everyone"?

21:17.250 --> 21:19.210
It's none of my business.

21:19.210 --> 21:23.410
Come on, don't say that. When we're
in trouble, we need to help each other.

21:25.030 --> 21:30.530
Madara, you might already know, but me and everyone down there were originally human.

21:30.530 --> 21:31.440
Human?

21:32.220 --> 21:35.600
Humans can't find food on their own.

21:35.600 --> 21:38.350
We haven't had anything good the past few days.

21:38.910 --> 21:40.510
You're a human?

21:41.820 --> 21:44.500
I saved a human?

21:45.320 --> 21:46.030
Madara-

21:46.030 --> 21:47.030
Get away from me!

21:47.270 --> 21:48.530
You guys, too!

21:48.530 --> 21:52.990
Get away from me, you humans!

21:59.850 --> 22:01.000
Madara...

22:05.240 --> 22:06.700
Damn humans...

23:40.940 --> 23:43.480
I never thought I'd have to fight Madara.

23:43.480 --> 23:46.440
He who is my life savior, teacher, and great friend!

23:46.440 --> 23:48.890
Honored Sister! Say the title away!

23:48.890 --> 23:49.800
Okay.

23:49.800 --> 23:52.950
Next time: Use the Melon Bread for the Battle, Please.

23:52.950 --> 23:54.260
Coming soon.
